@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api
@roleId = 1

### Create role
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Medico"
}

### Create MEDICO role
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "MEDICO"
}

### Create PACIENTE role
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
